      "writtenOn": "2020-08-03T20:20:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do we need to go through the boards and define this?\n\nActually, do you think we could just make an array of configuration objects in the vif file generator that specified all of this information for each project. I don\u0027t know what we will want to edit each board/baseboard\u0027s board.h to include this information.\n\nI think centralizing it all in one spot in the vif generation code will make it easier to find",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3985,
